  )}
  Built by <a href={PORTFOLIO} rel="me noopener">{NAME}</a><span class="aj-attribution__sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><a href={LINKEDIN} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
</p>

<style is:global>
  .aj-attribution { margin: 0; font: inherit; line-height: 1.5; color: inherit; }
